OL,3,ADemocrats win control of US House and
OL,4,Atake first Texas Senate seat in decades
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Democrats win a majority in the US
OL,7,FHouse of Representatives and seal
OL,8,Fhistoric wins in their battle to retake
OL,9,Fthe Senate - see the full results so
OL,10,Ffar
OL,12,FIn Texas, Democrat James Talarico wins
OL,13,Fthe party's first Senate seat in
OL,14,Fdecades
OL,16,FIn his first comments of the night,
OL,17,FDonald Trump writes on social media: "I
OL,18,Fwasn't on the ballot and if I was, we
OL,19,Fwould have won in a landslide!"
